  dialogPanel: {fileID: 1985457267}
  dialogText: {fileID: 349864007}
  dialogLines:
  - 'Stoner House is home to the InterCultural Life office, an organization on campus
    that helps students from all walks of life connect with the community. '
  - "Many groups at Cornell host events here\u2026 "
  - "the annual BACO (Black Awareness Cultural Organization) Kick-Off Cook Out at
    the beginning of the year includes fun yard games and a barbecue\u2026 "
  - "ISA (International Student Association) hosts heart-warming potlucks around
    the holidays when the weather outside is cold enough to knock your socks off\u2026 "
